    "- ✅ Automatic hardware detection (GPU/TPU/CPU)\n",
    "- ✅ Memory-optimized configurations\n",
    "- ✅ Automatic dataset download from GitHub\n",
    "- ✅ Progress tracking and visualization\n",
    "- ✅ Checkpoint saving\n",
    "\n",
